OL,3,GNEWSAHuge waste dump blamed on
OL,4,AEnvironment Agency delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 28,000 tonnes of waste has
OL,7,Fbeen left at a quarry where the
OL,8,Flandowner claims the Environment Agency
OL,9,F(EA) failed to act quickly enough over
OL,10,Frepeated permit breaches.
OL,12,FBuilding minerals supplier MB Wilkes
OL,13,Fsaid it now faced an estimated #3m bill
OL,14,Fto clear the site near Corfe Mullen in
OL,15,FDorset.
OL,17,FThe company said concerns were raised a
OL,18,Fyear after leasing the land to waste
OL,19,Foperator Hillier Recycling - but the
OL,20,Frubbish continued to arrive for six
OL,21,Fmore years before the EA revoked its
OL,22,Fpermits.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
