OL,3,GNEWSAHuge waste dump blamed on
OL,4,AEnvironment Agency delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men pleaded guilty to offences
OL,7,Frelating to the site in September, and
OL,8,Fthe EA said it would not respond to the
OL,9,Fallegations from MB Wilkes until after
OL,10,Fthe sentencing hearing later this
OL,11,Fmonth.
